corso di crescita per aiutare la madre. Tra le onde, la sabbia e il silenzio, la sua infanzia si intreccia con la durezza del dopoguerra e con la fragile bellezza di un’umanità che tenta di sopravvivere. Ma la fine del conflitto porta con sé un’ombra inattesa, che costringerà Nanning a guardare oltre l’orizzonte dell’innocenza.","tagline":"Germania 1945, la fine della Guerra raccontata dagli occhi di un bambino"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"On Amrum Island in spring 1945, twelve-year-old Nanning hunts seals, fishes at night, and works the fields to help feed his family. When the war ends, his mother sinks into depression, and he must navigate new conflicts while struggling to find his own path."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Amrum, 1945: Das Ende des Zweiten Weltkrieges steht unmittelbar bevor. Um seine Mutter in den letzten Kriegstagen zu unterstützen, ist sich der zwölfjährige Nanning (Jasper Billerbeck) für nichts zu schade. Er geht Seehunde jagen oder nachts fischen, Hauptsache, am Ende des Tages steht was zum Essen auf dem Tisch. Doch nachdem der Frieden eingekehrt ist, steht die Familie vor völlig neuen Problemen ..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b6wIO2bEe1Y9dJ3vcK7dYnxz3FT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiiQVnnEY4M2pz6iZkq59ls9fP.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1269644,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b6wIO2bEe1Y9dJ3vcK7dYnxz3FT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b6wIO2bEe1Y9dJ3vcK7dYnxz3FT.jpg","language":"it","width":1280,"height":1920},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b6wIO2bEe1Y9dJ3vcK7dYnxz3FT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b6wIO2bEe1Y9dJ3vcK7dYnxz3FT.jpg","language":"it","width":1280,"height